# Public Turing demo backing the hero live search (T478).
# Leave BOTH unset to keep the in-page demo on the bundled sample data.
# Set BOTH (at build time) to run REAL semantic search against the public demo
# instance (viglet/cloud → docker compose --profile demo; see docker/DEMO.md):
#
# VITE_TURING_DEMO_URL=https://demo.turing.viglet.org
# VITE_TURING_DEMO_SITE=mythical-creatures
